<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 00:32:49 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>美国战略储备如此之低，以至于储存美国石油的 60 个地下盐穴可能受到损害</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/17/depleted-us-strategic-oil-reserves-risk-damaging-salt-caverns-iran-war/</link><description>一位石油工程教授警告说：“只要原油库存降至 3 亿桶以下，我们就应该高度关注洞穴的完整性。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2274037724-e1786990176514.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 17 Aug 2026 18:22:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/17/depleted-us-strategic-oil-reserves-risk-damaging-salt-caverns-iran-war/</guid></item><item><title>“只有白痴初创公司创始人才会留在卡利”：马克·库班取消亿万富翁税，并在民主党内部造成裂痕</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/17/mark-cuban-california-billionaires-tax-wealth-ro-khanna/</link><description>这位商业大亨因担心对加州以外的年轻初创公司征税而向这位民主党经济爱国者开枪。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2276439982-e1786986929543.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 17 Aug 2026 19:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/17/mark-cuban-california-billionaires-tax-wealth-ro-khanna/</guid></item><item><title>据报道，新墨西哥州总检察长在 29 名总检察长在联邦审判中作证反对 Meta 的前一天推动了新的社交媒体安全法</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/17/new-mexico-attorney-general-social-media-safety-laws-states-federal-trial-meta-facebook-instagram/</link><description>新墨西哥州总检察长劳尔·托雷斯 (Raul Torrez) 正在起草两项法案，一项涉及 29 个州的儿童安全审判将于明天在奥克兰开庭。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2261841633-e1786997571961.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 17 Aug 2026 21:42:15 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/17/new-mexico-attorney-general-social-media-safety-laws-states-federal-trial-meta-facebook-instagram/</guid></item><item><title>摩根大通接近历史市场估值，“杰米溢价”接近 1 万亿美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/17/jamie-dimon-jpmorgan-valuation/</link><description>首席执行官杰米·戴蒙花了二十年的时间将摩根大通打造成华尔街的雄狮。他接任时其市值为1380亿美元&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2275286231-e1786984843773.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 17 Aug 2026 16:47:35 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/17/jamie-dimon-jpmorgan-valuation/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普从炸弹转向对伊朗的经济战。但德黑兰现在“全面进攻”，认为真正的战斗还没有开始</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/17/iran-economic-war-blockade-hormuz-escalation-attacks-oil/</link><description>一名伊朗官员告诉路透社，除非美国在几周内实施六月份的停火协议，否则伊朗将发动“及时而精确”的袭击以打破封锁。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2268963820-e1786976141223.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 17 Aug 2026 16:20:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/17/iran-economic-war-blockade-hormuz-escalation-attacks-oil/</guid></item><item><title>57 名特朗普官员的身价达到或超过 1 亿美元，是前三位总统身价总和的四倍</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/17/trump-wealthy-officials-biden-obama-bush/</link><description>这一统计是在只有 32% 的美国人赞同特朗普处理经济问题的情况下进行的，这一比例低于 40% &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26203727571685-e1786996574531.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 17 Aug 2026 20:24:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/17/trump-wealthy-officials-biden-obama-bush/</guid></item><item><title>检查你的冰箱：近 1900 万个鸡蛋属于 FDA 最严重的召回分类</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/17/egg-recall-salmonella-outbreak-fda-midwest-poultry/</link><description>与 98 人沙门氏菌爆发有关的近 1900 万个鸡蛋现在被 FDA 列为最高风险分类。有些可能还在冰箱里。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2289610085-e1786996762810.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 17 Aug 2026 20:09:20 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/17/egg-recall-salmonella-outbreak-fda-midwest-poultry/</guid></item><item><title>赛琳娜·戈麦斯 (Selena Gomez) 被心理健康初创公司投资者指控欺诈</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/14/selena-gomez-wondermind-fraud/</link><description>五位投资者指责 Gomez 和 Wondermind 联合创始人在这家初创公司 2025 年倒闭前三年隐瞒了财务困境&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2274329773-e1786711737431.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 12:55:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/14/selena-gomez-wondermind-fraud/</guid></item><item><title>与英伟达 (Nvidia) 的黄仁勋 (Jensen Huang) 一样，西门子首席执行官没有定期与直接下属开会以节省时间，他也只回复电子邮件“确定”或“否”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/17/siemens-ceo-roland-busch-workplace-efficiency-clean-email-inbox-no-one-on-one-meetings/</link><description>市值 2560 亿美元的西门子首席执行官罗兰·布希 (Roland Busch) 在回复电子邮件时只说“好”或“不”。如果再长一些，婴儿潮一代就会用语音通知他的团队正在行动。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2282234885-e1786978096446.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 17 Aug 2026 15:10:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/17/siemens-ceo-roland-busch-workplace-efficiency-clean-email-inbox-no-one-on-one-meetings/</guid></item><item><title>马尔科姆·格拉德威尔宁愿有一个年薪10万美元的父亲，也不愿有一个年薪10亿美元的父亲：极端的财富“会严重削弱你的动力”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/author-malcolm-gladwell-extreme-wealth-crippling-to-motivation-ambition-shaped-by-hardship-career-advice/</link><description>畅销书作家马尔科姆·格拉德威尔认为，在经济困难的情况下成长实际上可以更好地为孩子的成功做好准备。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2220629892-e1786634057321.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 15:56:04 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/author-malcolm-gladwell-extreme-wealth-crippling-to-motivation-ambition-shaped-by-hardship-career-advice/</guid></item></channel></rss>